A||N||29||AusFiero||Well Australia now has The Fiero Shop||||6||
Z||000000||AusFiero||08-13-2001||05:27 AM||||    I finally decided to bite the bullet today and stake my future on what I like doing most. Playing with Fieros. I registered the business name The Fiero Shop. So now the USA has one, Canada has 1 and Australia has 1 too. Well actually we have 2 but the other guy is in a different state and was silly enough not to register the web address <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroshop.com.au</A>  , even though I had advised him to do so 3 times before I started coming to Pennocks. <BR>    I had no intention of ever doing this but due to the requests and response just in here to things I make, I decided to take the risk and get into it fulltime. I now have my workshop (more for development and storage than anything, I prefer to pay to get things made and just develop new projects), my new name, stage 2 side scoops almost finished with the rest to follow and have even sold the last of my shares to setup properly. So in a few days time the new website will be active and it will be time to hit the market place beyond Pennocks to sell my wares.<BR>    Wish me luck as I pretty much have everything I own staked on this now. But judging by the orders coming in and the reponse to things I have done so far I think things should go well, hence staking so much on it. <BR>    Expect various new bodykits in the future as well as a complete rebody of my design for the Fiero further down the track. Other projects in the design stage include, dashboards, complete interior kits and much much more.<P>Now does anybody know where I can get a full list of all Fiero clubs in the USA. That is going to be the first place I start. Long post but I just had to say what I am up too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
