Z||000027||BlackDragon||08-13-2001||10:48 PM||||hey, how long will it be before the interior kits are up and running? are you planning on making one in black? have you ever done body work with carbon fiber? would you if there was a special request for it?||||reg||1
Z||000028||AusFiero||08-13-2001||11:08 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackDragon:<BR><B>hey, how long will it be before the interior kits are up and running? are you planning on making one in black? have you ever done body work with carbon fiber? would you if there was a special request for it?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>In 3 weeks the upholsterer can start making them BD. Black is no problem. Black on grey? with black piping? Black with black inserts?. Just let me know. Any colour combination will be no problem for now till I work oit the popular styles. Then they will be the standard and stocked. The new style console will be six weeks away as I have a lot to finish before then.<P>Yes I have been working with carbon fibre since it was a new (readily available) material. We used to make many race car panels out of it including the panels for the Audi factory rally team. Not a cheap material to work with though.<P>Now for some lunch.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000029||artherd||08-14-2001||03:37 AM||||AUS FIERO SHOP!!!  <P>It can aberivate to "Aus Fiero" or just "Aus" as we all know it's going to be you and your creativity we are dealing with :)<P>Best of luck man, and take it easy untill you're really recovered, we want to make fun of you as you grow old!!!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
